{"id":"e031439b28948954","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-thm-stationary-tower.md","title":"Stationary Tower","display":"thm-stationary-tower — Stationary Tower","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-stationary-tower","aliases":["58-thm-stationary-tower","Stationary Tower Forcing","Woodin's Stationary Tower"],"display":"thm-stationary-tower — Stationary Tower","depends_on":["[[58-df-woodin]]","[[58-df-zfc-stationary-tower-poset]]","[[58-df-generic-filter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-stationary-tower"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-stationary-tower</span><span>Stationary Tower Forcing</span><span>Woodin's Stationary Tower</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-stationary-tower — Stationary Tower"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"da3159c0c219916e\" href=\"?note=da3159c0c219916e\" title=\"58-df-woodin\">58-df-woodin</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3cd26e6e3fb18aa5\" href=\"?note=3cd26e6e3fb18aa5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-stationary-tower-poset\">58-df-zfc-stationary-tower-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"85bf4cca0e5f1662\" href=\"?note=85bf4cca0e5f1662\" title=\"58-df-generic-filter\">58-df-generic-filter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta,\\mathbb Q_{&lt;\\delta}\\in V\">\\(\\delta,\\mathbb Q_{&lt;\\delta}\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\">\\(\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> is an external set parameter in the forcing extension, not an element of the ground universe <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StationaryTowerPoset}_S(\\mathbb Q_{&lt;\\delta},\\delta)\">\\(\\mathrm{StationaryTowerPoset}_S(\\mathbb Q_{&lt;\\delta},\\delta)\\)</span> gives the condition carrier and projection order <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_\\delta\">\\(\\leq_\\delta\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterOnPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilterOnPoset}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S\\)</span> have the signatures registered in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"85bf4cca0e5f1662\" href=\"?note=85bf4cca0e5f1662\" title=\"58-df-generic-filter\">58-df-generic-filter</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VGeneric}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(G,P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{VGeneric}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(G,P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> is the ground-universe genericity relation defined below.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> is a class relation on the class carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassWellFounded}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(R,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassWellFounded}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(R,X)\\)</span> is the external well-foundedness relation defined below.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ult}(V,G)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ult}(V,G)\\)</span>, its membership relation, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,M\">\\(j,M\\)</span> are class-level objects; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists_{\\mathsf{Class}}\">\\(\\exists_{\\mathsf{Class}}\\)</span> marks that level.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall_{\\mathsf{Set}}\">\\(\\forall_{\\mathsf{Set}}\\)</span> denotes external quantification over all sets of the ambient forcing extension; it is not restricted to ground-model sets.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:V\\prec M\">\\(j:V\\prec M\\)</span> denotes class elementarity in the two-sorted metatheory.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}tower\\text{-}v\\text{-}generic}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{VGeneric}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(G,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilterOnPoset}_S(G,P,\\leq_P)\\land\n\\forall D\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\to G\\cap D\\neq\\varnothing\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}tower\\text{-}v\\text{-}generic}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{VGeneric}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(G,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilterOnPoset}_S(G,P,\\leq_P)\\land\n\\forall D\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\to G\\cap D\\neq\\varnothing\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}tower\\text{-}class\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ClassWellFounded}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(R,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall_{\\mathsf{Set}}A\\;\\left(\n\\varnothing\\neq A\\subseteq X\\to\n\\exists a\\in A\\;\\forall b\\in A\\;\\neg\\,bRa\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}tower\\text{-}class\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ClassWellFounded}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(R,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall_{\\mathsf{Set}}A\\;\\left(\n\\varnothing\\neq A\\subseteq X\\to\n\\exists a\\in A\\;\\forall b\\in A\\;\\neg\\,bRa\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}tower}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\\land\\mathrm{StationaryTowerPoset}_S(\\mathbb Q_{&lt;\\delta},\\delta)\\land\\mathrm{VGeneric}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(G,\\mathbb Q_{&lt;\\delta},\\leq_\\delta)\\to\\mathrm{ClassWellFounded}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\bigl(\\in^{\\operatorname{Ult}(V,G)},\\operatorname{Ult}(V,G)\\bigr)\\land\\exists_{\\mathsf{Class}}j,M\\;\\Bigl(j:V\\prec M\\land\\forall_{\\mathsf{Set}}y,z\\;\\bigl((y\\in M\\land z\\in y)\\to z\\in M\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1^V\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\\land j(\\omega_1^V)=\\delta\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}tower}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\\land\\mathrm{StationaryTowerPoset}_S(\\mathbb Q_{&lt;\\delta},\\delta)\\land\\mathrm{VGeneric}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(G,\\mathbb Q_{&lt;\\delta},\\leq_\\delta)\\to\\mathrm{ClassWellFounded}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\bigl(\\in^{\\operatorname{Ult}(V,G)},\\operatorname{Ult}(V,G)\\bigr)\\land\\exists_{\\mathsf{Class}}j,M\\;\\Bigl(j:V\\prec M\\land\\forall_{\\mathsf{Set}}y,z\\;\\bigl((y\\in M\\land z\\in y)\\to z\\in M\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1^V\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\\land j(\\omega_1^V)=\\delta\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Woodin: developed stationary tower forcing.</li>\n<li>Conditions are stationary sets of countable approximations, with the stationary-tower projection order.</li>\n<li>The generic filter is external to the ground universe and meets every ground-model dense subset.  It yields a class generic ultrapower and class elementary embedding; neither is reified as a set or passed to the set-coded elementary-embedding predicate.</li>\n<li>With sufficiently strong large cardinals, stationary tower forcing is tied to generic absoluteness and determinacy over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(\\mathbb{R})\">\\(L(\\mathbb{R})\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Applications: determinacy proofs, large cardinal preservation.</li>\n<li>Technical: requires deep analysis of stationary sets.</li>\n<li>Connection: bridges forcing, large cardinals, and descriptive set theory.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-woodin","status":"resolved","id":"da3159c0c219916e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-woodin]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-stationary-tower-poset","status":"resolved","id":"3cd26e6e3fb18aa5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-stationary-tower-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-generic-filter","status":"resolved","id":"85bf4cca0e5f1662","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-generic-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-generic-filter","status":"resolved","id":"85bf4cca0e5f1662","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$, $\\mathrm{ZfcFilterOnPoset}_S$, and $\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S$ have the signatures registered in [[58-df-generic-filter]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\delta,\\mathbb Q_{<\\delta}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StationaryTowerPoset}_S(\\mathbb Q_{<\\delta},\\delta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterOnPoset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VGeneric}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(G,P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClassWellFounded}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(R,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ult}(V,G)","display":false},{"tex":"j,M","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists_{\\mathsf{Class}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall_{\\mathsf{Set}}","display":false},{"tex":"j:V\\prec M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}tower\\text{-}v\\text{-}generic}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{VGeneric}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(G,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilterOnPoset}_S(G,P,\\leq_P)\\land\n\\forall D\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\to G\\cap D\\neq\\varnothing\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}tower\\text{-}class\\text{-}well\\text{-}founded}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ClassWellFounded}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(R,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall_{\\mathsf{Set}}A\\;\\left(\n\\varnothing\\neq A\\subseteq X\\to\n\\exists a\\in A\\;\\forall b\\in A\\;\\neg\\,bRa\n\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}tower}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\\land\\mathrm{StationaryTowerPoset}_S(\\mathbb Q_{<\\delta},\\delta)\\land\\mathrm{VGeneric}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(G,\\mathbb Q_{<\\delta},\\leq_\\delta)\\to\\mathrm{ClassWellFounded}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\bigl(\\in^{\\operatorname{Ult}(V,G)},\\operatorname{Ult}(V,G)\\bigr)\\land\\exists_{\\mathsf{Class}}j,M\\;\\Bigl(j:V\\prec M\\land\\forall_{\\mathsf{Set}}y,z\\;\\bigl((y\\in M\\land z\\in y)\\to z\\in M\\bigr)\\land\\forall\\alpha<\\omega_1^V\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\\land j(\\omega_1^V)=\\delta\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"L(\\mathbb{R})","display":false}],"bytes":3407,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4438","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-thm-stationary-tower.md|58-thm-s